@startuml 27_timing_heartbeat
title Host heartbeat freshness (illustrative, each unit = 10 s)
robust "Host connection state" as H
@0
H is PENDING
@1
H is CONNECTED
@2
H is CONNECTED
@3
H is CONNECTED
@7
H is STALE
@8
H is CONNECTED
legend bottom
  Accepted reports at t=10, 20, 30 and 80 seconds.
  At t=70, no report has arrived for 40 seconds:
  beyond the proposed 35-second stale threshold.
  STALE does not prove the physical host is powered off.
endlegend
@enduml
